[quote] [b]Notice:[/b] Some Cold War naval content is currently unfinished. Playing VUCE-produced Cold War content may result in an incomplete experience. (VUCE: VNR+UTTNH Compatch Expand) [/quote]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]✨ Features[/h1] By using this mod, you can make [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2993766165]VNR[/url] and [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3413890094]UTTNH[/url] compatible. Unlike most patches, [b]this mod expands VNR into the 1990s![/b]

UTTNH's vanilla-style designer prevents the AI from designing effective ships, which reduces late-game playability. VNR solves this, but its tech tree originally ends in 1955. This mod bridges that gap, using VNR's advanced designer and AI logic while guiding technology all the way to the 90s.

